      ],
      "text": "Website tựhọc IELTS: https://ielts-fighter.com\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        84.81104278564453,
        99.86299896240234,
        104.31244659423828
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        104.793701171875,
        520.0523681640625,
        143.51361083984375
      ],
      "text": "But in this country anyway, that all changed decades ago. And yet loneliness is\na more recent problem.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.45205688476562,
        128.42164611816406,
        175.95346069335938
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        176.43470764160156,
        511.46148681640625,
        234.95361328125
      ],
      "text": "I suppose so. A more plausible explanation is that people are having to move\naround for work and often end up living miles away from their family and\nfriends.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        247.8920440673828,
        99.86299896240234,
        267.3934326171875
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        267.87469482421875,
        139.8588104248047,
        286.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "That's true.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        299.6110534667969,
        128.42164611816406,
        319.1124572753906
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        319.59368896484375,
        494.6514587402344,
        358.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Looking at the studies on health risks and loneliness, there are claims that\nloneliness has as much impact as smoking 15 cigarettes a day.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        371.2520446777344,
        99.86299896240234,
        390.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        391.23468017578125,
        487.2546081542969,
        429.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "Or similar to the risks caused by obesity. But I'm not sure there's enough\nevidence for some of these claims.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        442.77203369140625,
        128.42164611816406,
        462.2734375
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        462.87469482421875,
        515.6928100585938,
        521.392578125
      ],
      "text": "Well, what about that one in Finland, which showed that loneliness increased\nthe risk of cancer by about 10%? And those findings have been supported by\nother studies too.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        534.2110595703125,
        99.86299896240234,
        553.7124633789062
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        554.314697265625,
        521.4559936523438,
        612.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "You're right about that one. I was actually thinking of the studies on dementia.\nSome found no association between loneliness and dementia, and others\nfound the opposite.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        625.6520385742188,
        128.42164611816406,
        645.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        645.7537231445312,
        496.64501953125,
        684.4736328125
      ],
      "text": "Not exactly reliable, then. There's been a lot of research on cardiovascular\ndisease and whether loneliness contributes to that.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        697.2920532226562,
        99.86299896240234,
        716.79345703125
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        717.3937377929688,
        518.13037109375,
        736.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Yes, I read that it was hard to reach a judgment, as the definition of loneliness\n"
    }
